{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_026","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Description","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":5916,"char_end":5961,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_027","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tfPassive 0x00010000 65536 Do not consume offers that exactly match this one, only offers that cross it. This makes it possible to set up offers in the ledger that peg the exchange rate at a specific value.","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":5965,"char_end":6171,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_028","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tfImmediateOrCancel 0x00020000 131072 Treat the offer as an Immediate or Cancel order and do not place an Offer entry into the order books. The transaction trades as much as it can by consuming existing offers when it&#x27;s processed.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6173,"char_end":6408,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_029","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tfFillOrKill 0x00040000 262144 Treat the offer as a Fill or Kill order , do not place an Offer entry into the order books, and cancel the offer if it cannot be fully filled at the time of execution. By default, this means that the owner must receive the full TakerPays amount; if the tfSell flag is enabled, the owner must be able to spend the entire TakerGets amount instead.","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":6410,"char_end":6786,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_030","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tfSell 0x00080000 524288 Exchange the entire TakerGets amount, even if it means obtaining more than the TakerPays amount in exchange.","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":6788,"char_end":6921,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_031","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tfHybrid 0x00100000 1048576 Make this a hybrid offer that can use both a permissioned DEX and the open DEX. The DomainID field must be provided when using this flag.","location_hint":"paragraph 247","char_start":6923,"char_end":7088,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_032","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"Requires the PermissionedDEX amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 248","char_start":7090,"char_end":7141,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_033","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecDIR_FULL The owner owns too many items in the ledger, or the order book contains too many Offers at the same exchange rate already.\nThis error is effectively impossible to receive if","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":7188,"char_end":7373,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_034","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"Requires the fixDirectoryLimit . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 252","char_start":7375,"char_end":7418,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_035","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecEXPIRED The transaction specifies an Expiration time that has already passed.","location_hint":"paragraph 254","char_start":7433,"char_end":7513,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_036","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecFROZEN The transaction involves a token on a frozen trust line (including local and global freezes). The TakerPays (buy amount) token has been deep-frozen by the issuer.","location_hint":"paragraph 255","char_start":7515,"char_end":7687,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_037","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecINSUF_RESERVE_OFFER The owner does not have enough XRP to meet the reserve requirement of adding a new offer ledger entry, and the transaction did not convert any currency. (If the transaction successfully traded any amount, the transaction succeeds with the result code tesSUCCESS , but does not create an offer ledger entry for the remainder.)","location_hint":"paragraph 256","char_start":7689,"char_end":8037,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_038","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecKILLED The transaction specifies tfFillOrKill , and the full amount cannot be filled. If the ImmediateOfferKilled amendment is enabled, this result code also occurs when the transaction specifies tfImmediateOrCancel and executes without moving funds (previously, an Immediate or Cancel offer would return tesSUCCESS even if no funds were moved).","location_hint":"paragraph 257","char_start":8039,"char_end":8387,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_039","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecNO_AUTH The transaction involves a token whose issuer uses Authorized Trust Lines and the the trust line that would receive the tokens exists but has not been authorized.","location_hint":"paragraph 258","char_start":8389,"char_end":8562,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_040","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecNO_ISSUER The transaction specifies a token whose issuer value is not a funded account in the ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 259","char_start":8564,"char_end":8668,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_041","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecNO_LINE The transaction involves a token whose issuer uses Authorized Trust Lines and the necessary trust line does not exist.","location_hint":"paragraph 260","char_start":8670,"char_end":8799,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_042","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecNO_PERMISSION The transaction uses a DomainID but the sender is not a member of that domain.","location_hint":"paragraph 261","char_start":8801,"char_end":8896,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_043","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"Requires the PermissionedDEX amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 262","char_start":8898,"char_end":8949,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_044","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"tecUNFUNDED_OFFER The owner does not hold a positive amount of the TakerGets currency. (Exception: if TakerGets specifies a token that the owner issues, the transaction can succeed.)","location_hint":"paragraph 263","char_start":8953,"char_end":9135,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_045","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"temBAD_CURRENCY The transaction specifies a fungible token incorrectly, such as a fungible token with the currency code \"XRP\".","location_hint":"paragraph 264","char_start":9137,"char_end":9263,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_046","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"temBAD_EXPIRATION The transaction contains an Expiration field that is not validly formatted.","location_hint":"paragraph 265","char_start":9265,"char_end":9358,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_047","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"temBAD_ISSUER The transaction specifies a token with an invalid issuer value.","location_hint":"paragraph 266","char_start":9360,"char_end":9437,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_048","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"temBAD_OFFER The offer tries to trade XRP for XRP, or tries to trade an invalid or negative amount of a token.","location_hint":"paragraph 267","char_start":9439,"char_end":9549,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_049","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"temBAD_SEQUENCE The transaction contains an OfferSequence that is not validly formatted, or is higher than the transaction&#x27;s own Sequence number.","location_hint":"paragraph 268","char_start":9551,"char_end":9701,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5a1d70d24fc1_050","source_id":"src_5a1d70d24fc1","source_hash":"a9417de281a3be879864da86dff8ca83a53fc77465e5d3adc3e063c877c43ef7","text":"temINVALID_FLAG The transaction specifies an invalid flag combination, such as both tfImmediateOrCancel and tfFillOrKill , or the transaction uses tfHybrid but omits the DomainID field.","location_hint":"paragraph 269","char_start":9703,"char_end":9888,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:30.773Z"}
